### Layer 5: Robust Sync Engine (`akauntme-frontend-2026/app/lib/SyncEngine.ts`)

#### [MODIFY] [SyncEngine.ts](file:///c:/Users/MarkThaValor/Documents/Akauntme/akauntme-frontend-2026/app/lib/SyncEngine.ts)
- Replace legacy one-by-one uncoordinated sync with a resilient queue processor:
  - Tracks sync status: `'synced' | 'syncing' | 'pending' | 'offline' | 'error'`.
  - Tracks `pendingCount`.
  - Handles reconnection gracefully when `online` event fires.
  - Sends batches to `/api/v1/sync` (falling back to individual idempotent endpoints if needed).
  - Updates local IndexedDB entities with authoritative server IDs, timestamps, and marks them `synced`.
  - Removes completed operations from `sync_queue`.
  - Reconciles inventory: updates product stock to match authoritative server response.
  - Exposes reactive event hooks for UI components.

